:gdoc.
:body.
:h1 id=lists.Lists
:p.The formatting profile indents lists with .in and .of and tabs to
the text with .is (html/dcfstarter-lists: one block per item with
the hanging indention, the identifier an inline block as wide as the
indention, a wider term followed by one blank).
:ol.
:li.The first item of the list, long enough to need a second output
line so that the hanging indention of the item text can be seen.
:li.The second item, with a nested list:
:ol.
:li.a nested item
:li.another nested item
:eol.
:lp.A list part, at the label position.
:eol.
:dl tsize=8.
:dthd.Term
:ddhd.Description
:dt.GML
:dd.Generalized Markup Language: tags that say what a part of the
document is, not how it looks.
:dt.Too-long-term
:dd.A term wider than the term column is followed by one blank.
:edl.
:h5.Run-in heading.
:p.The text of a level five heading continues on the same line.
:egdoc.
